@startuml get-info
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/v1/user/info
caption CRB-10, CRB-38 · 내 정보, 가입 다음 단계(next_step), 재동의 필요 여부, 유형별 정보

actor Client
participant "AnyStatusGuard" as Guard
participant "UserController" as Controller
participant "UserService" as Service
participant "AuthService" as AuthService
participant "UserRepository" as UserRepository
participant "CoffeeChatContactRepository" as CoffeeChatContactRepository
participant "StudentRepository" as StudentRepository
participant "GraduatedRepository" as GraduatedRepository
database PostgreSQL
participant "S3"

Client -> Guard: GET /api/v1/user/info\nAuthorization: Bearer <access token>
ref over Client, Guard: authenticate() — flow/auth-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token
note right of Guard: 가입 상태와 관계없이 통과 (pending · active)
Guard -> Controller: getInfo(user)
Controller -> Service: getInfo(userCtx)

par 동시에 조회 — 유형이 필요한 조회는 토큰 클레임의 type(claimType)으로
  Service -> UserRepository: findByPk(userPk)
  UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT users (is_deleted = false\nAND withdraw_requested_at IS NULL)
  UserRepository --> Service: user | null
else
  Service -> CoffeeChatContactRepository: findByUserPk(userPk)
  CoffeeChatContactRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT coffee_chat_contact
  CoffeeChatContactRepository --> Service: contact | null
else
  Service -> UserRepository: findSignupProgress(userPk, claimType)
  UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: 필수 약관 미동의 여부,\n유형별 인증(verified_at) · 추가 정보 존재 여부
  UserRepository --> Service: { hasMissingRequiredConsent, verified, hasProfile }
else claimType = student
  Service -> StudentRepository: findByUserPkWithLatestProfile(userPk)
  StudentRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT student\nLEFT JOIN LATERAL (student_profile JOIN department,\n첨부는 json_agg ORDER BY sort_order,\nORDER BY version DESC LIMIT 1)
  note right: 현재 정보 = 가장 큰 version.\n재학생 행 · 프로필 · 학과 · 첨부를 한 쿼리로
  StudentRepository --> Service: { student, latest: { profile, department, attachments } | null }
else claimType = graduated
  Service -> GraduatedRepository: findByUserPkWithProfile(userPk)
  GraduatedRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT graduated LEFT JOIN graduated_profile
  GraduatedRepository --> Service: { graduated, profile | null }
else
  Service -> AuthService: touchLastActive(userPk)
  AuthService -> UserRepository: updateLastActiveAt(userPk)
  UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE users SET last_active_at = now()\nWHERE is_deleted = false
  note right: 유저 조회와 동시에 실행되므로\n탈퇴한 유저는 건드리지 않게 조건을 둠
end
note right of Service: 트랜잭션 없음 (조회 + 최근 접속 시각 갱신만)

alt 유저 없음 (탈퇴 · 탈퇴 유예기간 중)
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 401 User not found
end

opt DB의 type ≠ claimType
  note over Service
    다른 기기에서 가입 중 유형을 바꾼 뒤 남은 access token (최대 access token 수명).
    응답은 DB의 type · status 기준이어야 하므로 유형이 필요한 조회만 다시 함
  end note
  par DB type으로 다시 조회
    Service -> UserRepository: findSignupProgress(userPk, user.type)
    UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: 필수 약관 미동의 여부, 인증 · 추가 정보 존재 여부
  else
    Service -> StudentRepository: findByUserPkWithLatestProfile(userPk)
    note right: user.type = student일 때
  else
    Service -> GraduatedRepository: findByUserPkWithProfile(userPk)
    note right: user.type = graduated일 때
  end
end

opt type = student이고 추가 정보가 있음
  loop source = file인 첨부
    Service -> S3: getPresignedUrl(key)
    note right: 비공개 버킷이라 url 은 presigned GET URL (기본 600초)로 내려줌.\n서명은 서버에서 계산 (S3 호출 없음).\n응답에 key(최종 key)와 file_name 도 같이 내려줌:\n수정 때 기존 파일을 유지하려고 다시 보내는 값
    alt 서명 실패 (FileService가 InternalServerErrorException)
      Service -[#red]-> Client: 500 Internal Server Error
    end
  end
end

Service -> Service: next_step = calculateNextStep(status, progress)\nconsent_required = active && hasMissingRequiredConsent
note right of Service
  pending: next_step으로 안내 (consent → verify → profile), consent_required = false
  active: next_step = null, 개정된 필수 약관에 동의하지 않았으면 consent_required = true
  null 배열(activities, hashtags, links)은 []로 응답
end note
Service --> Controller: UserInfoDto
Controller --> Client: 200 { id, type, status, next_step, name, email,\nconsent_required, student, graduated }

@enduml
